    {
      "id": "claim_4c0cbf2b288541e69d1c08f06c3574cf",
      "statement": "PairedFidelitySpec is the registry's second generative spec alongside FIDSpec: its knobs are subset_size (8), every_n_epochs (1), num_inference_steps (None) and seed (0), it declares logged_metrics {'val/psnr', 'val/ssim'}, and its build() constructs PairedFidelityCallback from the same CallbackContext runtime objects (module, vae, datamodule).",
      "evidence": [
