    {
      "id": "claim_e8d51d74cdff4cb7874786b5a9633f56",
      "statement": "The paired-fidelity rollout step count is recipe-primary: with its own num_inference_steps knob unset (None), build() reads ctx.inference_recipe['num_inference_steps']; an explicit per-callback value overrides the recipe; with neither present the callback's own default of 15 applies.",
