      "id": "claim_196940cc38ca4030a22ce9fba6d2f2e7",
      "statement": "The supervised ControlNet shell registers paired_fidelity by default and fills CallbackContext.inference_recipe — previously None on that path — with the controlnet.num_inference_steps rollout count, so the observe-only monitor runs without any opt-in.",
