      "id": "claim_f3414ad6df5644819b88382ccebd4cef",
      "statement": "Declaring val/psnr and val/ssim in PairedFidelitySpec.logged_metrics only makes them validatable checkpoint monitors: the supervised shell's default checkpoint monitor stays val/x0_mae, and the monitor never enters the loss, the optimizer, EMA, or checkpoint selection.",
