      "id": "claim_9d77a22b889f4f19a04448a2551f9f80",
      "statement": "The GRPO shell still registers only train_loss, fid and checkpoint — paired_fidelity is deliberately not registered on the ControlNet-GRPO stage, which ADR-0037 treats as a separate follow-up — and on the ControlNet policy path it force-drops fid after the merge through forbidden_callbacks while forbidden_monitors rejects a val/fid checkpoint monitor before resolution.",
