      "statement": "CheckpointSpec.build reproduces the prior two-branch checkpoint construction: monitor_metric=None keeps save_top_k=1 plus last.ckpt at the every_n_epochs cadence, while the monitored branch tracks the monitor top-k plus last, with filename templates unet3d-{epoch:03d}-{step} and unet3d-{epoch:03d}-{step}-{monitor:.3f}.",
