      "id": "claim_e790bf175437470ea3c0aff47e0bdd9e",
      "statement": "The paired-fidelity monitor is redundant under DDP rather than sharded: every rank evaluates the same fixed subset under the same seeded noise on DDP-synchronized weights, so the only cross-rank interaction is Lightning's torchmetrics sync, and the 2-rank gate asserts no deadlock and identical per-rank scores.",
